	\L_0558a:
	ZM 32:
	ZH 1:
	'　　　Leazas Castle'
	R
	ZM 24:
	ZH 1:
	R
	'　　　　　Audience Room'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_05552:
	ZH 1:
	'Call him.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_0558a:
	ZH 1:
	'At Rance’s order, the Temple'
	R
	'Knight captain from the AL'
	R
	'Church appeared.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_0556e:
	ZH 1:
	'Gross...'
	R
	'A giant man in giant armor and'
	R
	'a giant helmet...'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_055c2:
	ZH 1:
	'Did you summon me, King Rance?'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_05552:
	ZH 1:
	'Mhm.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_055c2:
	ZH 1:
	'What do you require...?'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_05552:
	ZH 1:
	'Are you an AList, too?'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_055c2:
	ZH 1:
	'Of course.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_05552:
	ZH 1:
	'............'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_055c2:
	ZH 1:
	'Could it be...?'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_05552:
	ZH 1:
	'Hm?'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_055c2:
	ZH 1:
	'King Rance, do you not follow'
	R
	'ALism?'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_0556e:
	ZH 1:
	'Hm～... If I say I don’t this'
	R
	'guy’ll probably start a revolt.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_05552:
	ZH 1:
	'...Of course I do.'
	R
	'I’m also an AList.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_0558a:
	ZH 1:
	'Rance lied.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_055c2:
	ZH 1:
	'I see.'
	R
	'I believed as much.'
	\L_05677:
	ZH 1:
	'I hope we can fight together'
	R
	'for the sake of ALism and'
	R
	'world peace.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_05552:
	ZH 1:
	'Mhm.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_055c2:
	ZH 1:
	'Then let us pray together,'
	R
	'King Rance.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_05552:
	ZH 1:
	'Uh...'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_055c2:
	ZH 1:
	'Our angels in heaven...'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_0558a:
	ZH 1:
	'The Temple Knight captain'
	R
	'kneeled, then looked up at the'
	R
	'heavens and began to pray.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_0556e:
	ZH 1:
	'Ch... This is annoying...'
	R
	'What should I say?'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_05552:
	ZH 1:
	'Amen, ramen, noodle, eggs...'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_0558a:
	ZH 1:
	R
	'.........'
	\L_05677:
	ZH 1:
	R
	'......'
	\L_05677:
	ZH 1:
	R
	'...'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_055c2:
	ZH 1:
	'Haah... King Rance.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_05552:
	ZH 1:
	'What?'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_055c2:
	ZH 1:
	'I’ve never heard the prayer'
	R
	'you gave before.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_05552:
	ZH 1:
	'Uh...'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_055c2:
	ZH 1:
	'I’d expect no less of you.'
	\L_05677:
	ZH 1:
	'Quite admirable to know of a'
	R
	'different scripture than we'
	R
	'Temple Knights.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_05552:
	ZH 1:
	'Gahahahahaha.'
	R
	'That’s because I’m a king.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_055c2:
	ZH 1:
	'Now excuse me, King Rance.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_05552:
	ZH 1:
	'Mhm.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_05624:
	\L_0558a:
	ZH 1:
	'The Temple Knight slowly bowed'
	R
	'and walked away from the'
	R
	'throne.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	!VAR0516 : 6!
	\L_05616:
	\L_055c2:
	ZH 1:
	'You’re an AList, King Rance?'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_05552:
	ZH 1:
	'No way.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_055c2:
	ZH 1:
	'Of course... I thought not.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_05552:
	ZH 1:
	'Are you, Maris?'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_055c2:
	ZH 1:
	'I only believe in Queen Lia.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_0556e:
	ZH 1:
	'That’s... a bit frightening.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_0558a:
	ZH 1:
	'But Rance didn’t say that out'
	R
	'loud.'
	\L_05677:
