	\L_0558a:
	ZM 32:
	ZH 1:
	'　　Kawanakajima'
	R
	ZM 24:
	ZH 1:
	R
	'　　AL Church HQ'
	\L_05677:
	ZH 1:
	'There is a great river between'
	R
	'Leazas and Zeth called Tenma'
	R
	'River.'
	\L_05677:
	ZH 1:
	'In its center is a big island'
	R
	'called Kawanakajima.'
	\L_05677:
	ZH 1:
	'On it was the headquarters of'
	R
	'the largest religious group,'
	\L_05677:
	ZH 1:
	'with believers across the'
	R
	'continent, the AL Church.'
	\L_05677:
	ZH 1:
	'It was considered sacred'
	R
	'ground and received no'
	R
	'aggression from any nation.'
	\L_05677:
	ZH 1:
	'In the Representative’s Room'
	R
	'on that sacred ground, one man'
	R
	'was standing.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	!VAR0516 : 464!
	\L_055a6:
	\L_0558a:
	ZH 1:
	'It was the leader of the AL'
	R
	'Church, the man revered as the'
	R
	'representative of God,'
	\L_05677:
	ZH 1:
	'Pope Mulalaloux.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_05552:
	ZH 1:
	'Seconaot...'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_0558a:
	ZH 1:
	'A low but easily audible voice'
	R
	'echoed through the large room.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	!VAR0516 : 486!
	\L_05616:
	\L_055c2:
	ZH 1:
	'Yes...'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_055fa:
	ZH 1:
	'One of the Council of Five that'
	R
	'were always around Pope'
	R
	'Mulalaloux, Seconaot,'
	\L_05677:
	ZH 1:
	'kneeled before him.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_05552:
	ZH 1:
	'I got your report...'
	R
	'Good work...'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_055c2:
	ZH 1:
	'No... I only did what’s'
	R
	'expected of me, Your Holiness.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_05552:
	ZH 1:
	'It’s all as the prophecy says.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_055c2:
	ZH 1:
	'Prophecy...?'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_05552:
	ZH 1:
	'Yes. I haven’t told all of you,'
	R
	'but I’ve known this would'
	R
	'happen for the last ten years.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_0558a:
	ZH 1:
	'Pope Mulalaloux opened a large'
	R
	'trunk and took out one of a'
	R
	'collection of 12 thick books...'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_05552:
	ZH 1:
	'Aah... Here.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_0558a:
	ZH 1:
	'He flipped through the pages'
	R
	'and showed Seconaot a certain'
	R
	'one.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_055c2:
	ZH 1:
	'Excuse me.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_055fa:
	ZH 1:
	'Seconaot peeked at the book.'
	\L_05677:
	ZH 1:
	'［A savage man will appear from'
	R
	' the land to the west and'
	R
	' bring the country to ruin.'
	\L_05677:
	ZH 1:
	'　It will be the time of'
	R
	' 23 mice... Then...］'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_055c2:
	ZH 1:
	'23 mice...'
	R
	'This isn’t the right time,'
	R
	'then...'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_05552:
	ZH 1:
	'Don’t read it like that. King'
	R
	'Rance is currently 20 years'
	R
	'old...'
	\L_05677:
	ZH 1:
	'What do you get when you'
	R
	'subtract 20 from 23?'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_055c2:
	ZH 1:
	'...Yes, 3... As in... LP3...'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_05552:
	ZH 1:
	'Yes, that is correct.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_055c2:
	ZH 1:
	'Your Holiness... Do you know'
	R
	'what will happen next?'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_05552:
	ZH 1:
	'It is written.'
	R
	'On the next page...'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_055c2:
	ZH 1:
	'Please tell us, Your Holiness.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_05552:
	ZH 1:
	'I can’t do that. This book of'
	R
	'prophecy contains the'
	R
	'frightening future of mankind.'
	\L_05677:
	ZH 1:
	'It’s so terrifying that any'
	R
	'man other than me who views it'
	R
	'would be driven mad.'
	\L_05677:
	ZH 1:
	'But if nobody reads it, nobody'
	R
	'can lead humanity into the'
	R
	'future.'
	\L_05677:
	ZH 1:
	'So I take it upon myself to'
	R
	'read it.'
	\L_05677:
	ZH 1:
	'My powerful soul is able to'
	R
	'withstand it.'
	\L_05677:
	ZH 1:
	'So, Seconaot...'
	R
	'Restrain your curiosity.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_055c2:
	ZH 1:
	'...I apologize.'
	R
	'I was too intrusive.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_05552:
	ZH 1:
	'Quite all right... As long as'
	R
	'you act according to my will...'
	\L_05677:
	ZH 1:
	'Yes... In order to save'
	R
	'humanity, the pitiful lambs...'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_0558a:
	ZH 1:
	'Mulalaloux spread his arms and'
	R
	'squinted at the heavens.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_055c2:
	ZH 1:
	'Yes, Your Holiness.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_0558a:
	ZH 1:
	'One more man appeared.'
	R
	'The Council’s Salbenaot.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_05624:
	!VAR0516 : 487!
	\L_05616:
	\L_055c2:
	ZH 1:
	'Excuse me, Your Holiness.'
	R
	'Have you decided how we are to'
	R
	'deal with Leazas?'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_05552:
	ZH 1:
	'Salbenaot...?'
	R
	'You came at a good time.'
	\L_05677:
	ZH 1:
	'I shall give you your'
	R
	'instructions, then.'
	\L_05677:
	ZH 1:
	'I hope for Leazas to continue to'
	R
	'be a good country that pays'
	R
	'their respects to God as they'
	\L_05677:
	ZH 1:
	'have always been.'
	\L_05677:
	ZH 1:
	'Salbenaot, please go to Leazas'
	R
	'as a messenger.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_055c2:
	ZH 1:
	'Yes. Understood. I shall impart'
	R
	'your will upon them and return'
	R
	'with good news.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_05552:
	ZH 1:
	'I’ll be waiting for it,'
	R
	'Salbenaot.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_055c2:
	ZH 1:
	'Yes, Your Holiness.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
