	\L_05616:
	\L_0558a:
	ZM 32:
	ZH 1:
	'　　　Leazas Castle'
	R
	ZM 24:
	ZH 1:
	R
	'　　　　　Audience Room'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_055c2:
	ZH 1:
	'King Rance, a messenger has'
	R
	'arrived from the AL Church.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_05552:
	ZH 1:
	'Why’s someone from the church'
	R
	'here...?'
	\L_05677:
	ZH 1:
	'Alright. Probably trying to'
	R
	'sell bibles. Is it a couple of'
	R
	'tidy-looking foreigners?'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_055c2:
	ZH 1:
	'It’s not. It’s someone from the'
	R
	'church’s council.'
	\L_05677:
	ZH 1:
	'They seem to have come to'
	R
	'introduce themselves.'
	\L_05677:
	ZH 1:
	'I believe I explained our'
	R
	'country’s relationship with the'
	R
	'AL Church to you before, but...'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_05552:
	ZH 1:
	'Hm～～～...'
	\L_05677:
	ZH 1:
	'Aah, I just remembered! They’re'
	R
	'the guys stealing all my money'
	R
	'in the form of donations!'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_055c2:
	ZH 1:
	'King... You’re yelling.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_05552:
	ZH 1:
	'Fine, I’ll give them a fair'
	R
	'meeting. Call them.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_055c2:
	ZH 1:
	'Understood.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_055fa:
	ZH 1:
	R
	'.........'
	\L_05677:
	ZH 1:
	R
	'......'
	\L_05677:
	ZH 1:
	R
	'...'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_05624:
	SS 20:
	!VAR0516 : 487!
	\L_05616:
	\L_055c2:
	ZH 1:
	'This is our first meeting,'
	R
	'King of Leazas.'
	\L_05677:
	ZH 1:
	'I am Salbenaot, representative'
	R
	'of the pope of the AL Church.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_05552:
	ZH 1:
	'Hmph. As I understand, you’re'
	R
	'just here to introduce yourself.'
	R
	'That means we’re already done.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_055c2:
	ZH 1:
	'Huh?'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_05552:
	ZH 1:
	'So now that that’s over...'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_055c2:
	ZH 1:
	'Huhu... It seems the new King'
	R
	'has a fine sense of humor.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_0556e:
	ZH 1:
	'I was serious, though...'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_055c2:
	ZH 1:
	'I requested an audience with you'
	R
	'today in order to ask that you'
	R
	'continue giving us the same'
	\L_05677:
	ZH 1:
	'donations as before.'
	\L_05677:
	ZH 1:
	'As you know, a church is made'
	R
	'up of followers...'
	\L_05677:
	ZH 1:
	'And our organization is shaped'
	R
	'by our followers’ donations.'
	\L_05677:
	ZH 1:
	'So... Please ensure our'
	R
	'request is fulfilled.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_055fa:
	ZH 1:
	'Salbenaot bowed very deeply to'
	R
	'Rance.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_05624:
	!VAR0516 : 6!
	\L_05616:
	\L_055c2:
	ZH 1:
	'King Rance...'
	R
	'Our country’s not the only one'
	R
	'that has ALists.'
	\L_05677:
	ZH 1:
	'Helman and Zeth both have a'
	R
	'large number of them as well,'
	\L_05677:
	ZH 1:
	'and donate a huge sum of money'
	R
	'to the AL Church.'
	\L_05677:
	ZH 1:
	'Most of the population is AList,'
	\L_05677:
	ZH 1:
	'so going against the church'
	R
	'would be very bad for our public'
	R
	'order.'
	\L_05677:
	ZH 1:
