	ZM 32:
	ZH 1:
	'　　  Kawanakajima'
	R
	ZM 24:
	ZH 1:
	R
	' AL Church HQ Rep’s Room'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_05552:
	ZH 1:
	'I should show up here as the'
	R
	'church’s boss every once in a'
	R
	'while.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_0558a:
	ZH 1:
	'Rance was there in his'
	R
	'Salbenaot disguise.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_0556e:
	ZH 1:
	'Doesn’t look like there’s'
	R
	'anything off...'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	!VAR0516 : 489!
	\L_05616:
	\L_055c2:
	ZH 1:
	'Salbenaot.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_05552:
	ZH 1:
	'Hm?'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_0556e:
	ZH 1:
	'Uh... This guy’s Beckdoran, if'
	R
	'I remember right.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_05552:
	ZH 1:
	'I’ve been out for a while.'
	R
	'Has anything happened?'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_055c2:
	ZH 1:
	'No, nothing in particular...'
	\L_05677:
	ZH 1:
	'There’s just some people with'
	R
	'some discontent over the Brutal'
	R
	'King, Rance.'
	\L_05677:
	ZH 1:
	'Especially higher class'
	R
	'people...'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_05552:
	ZH 1:
	'Why?'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_055c2:
	ZH 1:
	'They say that because they'
	R
	'donate a lot of money to us,'
	\L_05677:
	ZH 1:
	'they would like the church to'
	R
	'dispose of him...'
	\L_05677:
	ZH 1:
	'They’re dissatisfied that'
	R
	'however much money they put'
	R
	'forward,'
	\L_05677:
	ZH 1:
	'the church isn’t moving to'
	R
	'destroy King Rance.'
	\L_05677:
	ZH 1:
	'And of course they woul be.'
	\L_05677:
	ZH 1:
	'It’s natural they’d be mad if'
	R
	'the man who killed their god’s'
	R
	'representative is being left'
	\L_05677:
	ZH 1:
	'alone after all their donating.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_05552:
	ZH 1:
	'Who is it that’s mad?'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_055c2:
	ZH 1:
	'The people that always give'
	R
	'large donations. I can’t'
	R
	'remember their names.'
	\L_05677:
	ZH 1:
	'You can look at the account'
	R
	'book. It says who’s donated'
	R
	'how much.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_05552:
	ZH 1:
	'I’ll look at that, then.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_055c2:
	ZH 1:
	'Yes...'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_0556e:
	ZH 1:
	'How dare they defy me... Next'
	R
	'time I’ll erase everything they'
	R
	'own so they can’t resist.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_055c2:
	ZH 1:
	'Why do you ask about that?'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_05552:
	ZH 1:
	'Uh... No reason.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_055b4:
	\L_05624:
	SS VAR0515:
	\L_0558a:
	ZH 1:
	'After that, Rance made the'
	R
	'proper rounds and left.'
