	ZM 32:
	ZH 1:
	'　　Kawanakajima'
	R
	ZM 24:
	ZH 1:
	R
	' AL Church HQ Rep’s Room'
	\L_05677:
	ZH 1:
	'Rance came dressed as'
	R
	'Salbenaot once again.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_0556e:
	ZH 1:
	'Huhuhu. This disguise is perfect'
	R
	'in every way. Now... Where'
	R
	'should I go?'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_0558a:
	ZH 1:
	'Rance walked around to various'
	R
	'places.'
	\L_05677:
	ZH 1:
	'A man called out to him in'
	R
	'front of the Morning Atonement'
	R
	'Room.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	!VAR0516 : 488!
	\L_05616:
	\L_055c2:
	ZH 1:
	'You’ve been going on a lot of'
	R
	'trips despite His Holiness'
	R
	'being gone, Salbenaot.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_0556e:
	ZH 1:
	'This guy is Contaot, I think.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_05552:
	ZH 1:
	'I’ve had a lot to deal with.'
	R
	'I will continue traveling for'
	R
	'the sake of the Church.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_055c2:
	ZH 1:
	'...Things seem to have calmed'
	R
	'down recently.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_055fa:
	ZH 1:
	'Contaot smelled faintly of'
	R
	'alcohol.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_055c2:
	ZH 1:
	'I guess that proves that the'
	R
	'Pope really was deserving of'
	R
	'divine punishment like King'
	\L_05677:
	ZH 1:
	'Rance said, too.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_05552:
	ZH 1:
	'Oh... Did you learn something'
	R
	'while I was gone?'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_055c2:
	ZH 1:
	'Yes... He was pocketing a'
	R
	'large sum of the church’s'
	R
	'money.'
	\L_05677:
	ZH 1:
	'He was filling his pockets'
	R
	'with the followers’ donations.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_05552:
	ZH 1:
	'Good idea...'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_055c2:
	ZH 1:
	'Did you say something?'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_05552:
	ZH 1:
	'No... I was just saying I was'
	R
	'shocked...'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_055c2:
	ZH 1:
	'Really...?'
	\L_05677:
	ZH 1:
	'But because of that, the anti-'
	R
	'King Rance group has become'
	R
	'thoroughly disheartened.'
	\L_05677:
	ZH 1:
	'They don’t seem to have the'
	R
	'will to start a rebellion'
	R
	'anymore.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_0556e:
	ZH 1:
	'Lucky me!'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_05552:
	ZH 1:
	'Now excuse me...'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_055c2:
	ZH 1:
	'Where are you going?'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_05552:
	ZH 1:
	'I have a lot to take care of'
	R
	'too. Let us meet again.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_055c2:
	ZH 1:
	'Yeah...'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_0556e:
	ZH 1:
	'Haah... Well.'
	R
	'I guess the people here won’t'
	R
	'be resisting me anymore.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_0558a:
	ZH 1:
	'Rance left the Church'
	R
	'headquarters in high spirits.'
