	\L_05552:
	ZH 1:
	'............'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_055c2:
	ZH 1:
	'And so, the chaos in today’s'
	R
	'world is a test imparted on us'
	R
	'by God.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_0558a:
	ZH 1:
	'Rance has already been here'
	R
	'for an hour. He’s done nothing'
	R
	'but listen to the Pope talk.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_055c2:
	ZH 1:
	'King Rance, what do you think'
	R
	'when you see people distressed'
	R
	'over wealth inequality?'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_05552:
	ZH 1:
	'If they want money they can'
	R
	'just steal it.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_055c2:
	ZH 1:
	'You mustn’t think that way.'
	R
	'As a king, you have many'
	R
	'followers under you...'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_055fa:
	ZH 1:
	R
	'.........'
	\L_05677:
	ZH 1:
	R
	'......'
	\L_05677:
	ZH 1:
	R
	'...'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_05552:
	ZH 1:
	'...Zzzz...'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_055c2:
	ZH 1:
	'So...'
	R
	'Do you understand, King Rance?'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_05552:
	ZH 1:
	'Huh...? Ah, yeah, of course.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_055c2:
	ZH 1:
	'As expected of the king of a'
	R
	'nation.'
	R
	'You have fine ideas.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_05552:
	ZH 1:
	'Y-Yeah... I guess.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_0556e:
	ZH 1:
	'All this talk about this stuff'
	R
	'gave me a headache and put me to'
	R
	'sleep...'
	\L_05677:
	ZH 1:
	'When does he plan to stop?'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_055c2:
	ZH 1:
	'Also, King...'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_05552:
	ZH 1:
	'Aaaaaaaah!!'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_055c2:
	ZH 1:
	'What is it?'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_05552:
	ZH 1:
	'I just remembered something I'
	R
	'have to do. I’m going.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_055c2:
	ZH 1:
	'I see...'
	R
	'Unfortunate. There was more I'
	R
	'wanted to speak with you about.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_0556e:
	ZH 1:
	'I can’t take anymore.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_055c2:
	ZH 1:
	'Then be careful on your way'
	R
	'back, King Rance. May God’s'
	R
	'protection be with you...'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_05552:
	ZH 1:
	'Mhm.'
	R
	'See you.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_055fa:
	ZH 1:
	'Rance left Mulalaloux bowing'
