	ZM 32:
	ZH 1:
	'    Kawanakajima'
	R
	ZM 24:
	ZH 1:
	R
	'  AL Church HQ'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_05552:
	ZH 1:
	'This is the headquarters of the'
	R
	'world’s biggest religious'
	R
	'organization, the AL Church?'
	\L_05677:
	ZH 1:
	'Maybe I should take a look.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_0558a:
	ZH 1:
	'Rance entered the church'
	R
	'headquarters.'
	\L_05677:
	ZH 1:
	'Then he was led to the guest'
	R
	'room and sat in a soft chair.'
	\L_05677:
	ZH 1:
	'Then, after 5 minutes of'
	R
	'waiting...'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	!VAR0516 : 464!
	\L_05616:
	\L_055c2:
	ZH 1:
	'I’m sorry about the wait, King'
	R
	'Rance.'
	\L_05677:
	ZH 1:
	'I am the person in charge of the'
	R
	'AL Church, the representative of'
	R
	'God, Pope Mulalaloux.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_05552:
	ZH 1:
	'Hey, nice to meet you...'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_055fa:
	ZH 1:
	'Mulalaloux slowly lowered his'
	R
	'head towards Rance.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_055c2:
	ZH 1:
	'I’m very thankful that you'
	R
	'decided to travel all the way'
	R
	'out here.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_05552:
	ZH 1:
	'Not a problem.'
	R
	'I enjoyed the welcoming'
	R
	'reception.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_055c2:
	ZH 1:
	'I’m happy to hear that.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_055fa:
	ZH 1:
	'Mulalaloux sat in the chair in'
	R
	'front of Rance.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_055c2:
	ZH 1:
	'You have my deepest gratitude'
	R
	'for listening to my'
	R
	'messenger’s... Well, my request.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_05552:
	ZH 1:
	'Yeah...'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_0556e:
	ZH 1:
	'I didn’t really want to,'
	R
	'though... Damn it...'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_055c2:
	ZH 1:
	'By the way, King Rance.'
	\L_05677:
	ZH 1:
	'We would like to help Leazas’s'
	R
	'just unification of the world in'
	R
	'any meager way we can.'
	\L_05677:
	ZH 1:
	'It’s all for the people, and'
	R
	'for God...'
	\L_05677:
	ZH 1:
	'This fight for you, who gives'
	R
	'us such generous donations...'
	R
	'This is a crusade.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_0556e:
	ZH 1:
	'Uh... Huh...'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_055c2:
	ZH 1:
	'I hear that you even dare to'
	R
	'put your honor at stake for'
	R
	'the sake of uniting the world.'
	\L_05677:
	ZH 1:
	'It’s wonderful that you would'
	R
	'sacrifice yourself for the'
	R
	'sake of the people.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_05552:
	ZH 1:
	'Uh... Zzz...'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_055c2:
	ZH 1:
	'Also...'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_0558a:
	ZH 1:
	R
	'.........'
	\L_05677:
	ZH 1:
	R
	'......'
	\L_05677:
	ZH 1:
	R
	'...'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_05552:
	ZH 1:
	'............'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_055c2:
	ZH 1:
	'God is truly wonderful.'
	R
	'God allowed us to meet like'
	R
	'this... Oh, God...'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_05552:
	ZH 1:
	'I’m leaving.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_055c2:
	ZH 1:
	'Oh... Did something happen?'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_05552:
	ZH 1:
	'I got a headache...'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_0556e:
	ZH 1:
	'I just realized listening to all'
	R
	'this old guy’s religious talk is'
	R
	'only going to hurt my head...'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_055c2:
	ZH 1:
	'Aah... Then you mustn’t.'
	R
	'Allow me to offer you a bed...'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_05552:
	ZH 1:
	'It’s fine. I’m leaving.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_055c2:
	ZH 1:
	'All right... Be careful...'
	R
	'I pray for your safe return.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_055fa:
	ZH 1:
	'The effects of being hit by'
	R
	'Mulalaloux’s toxic personality'
	R
	'caused Rance to stumble out of'
	\L_05677:
	ZH 1:
	'the church headquarters.'
	\L_05677:
