*L_047fc:
	!VAR0566 : 6!
	!VAR0367 : 1!
	\L_055fa:
	ZH 1:
	'　　＜knock knock）'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_05624:
	!VAR0516 : 38!
	\L_05616:
	\L_055c2:
	ZH 1:
	'Excuse me, Your Holiness.'
	R
	'I brought tea.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_0556e:
	ZH 1:
	'Mm, a cute girl.'
	R
	'In a place like this...'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_05624:
	!VAR0516 : 464!
	\L_05616:
	\L_055c2:
	ZH 1:
	'Aah, thank you, Elisabeth.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_05552:
	ZH 1:
	'So you’re Elisabeth?'
	R
	'Cute name.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_05624:
	!VAR0516 : 38!
	\L_05616:
	\L_055c2:
	ZH 1:
	'Oh, please don’t, Your'
	R
	'Majesty...'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_05624:
	!VAR0516 : 464!
	\L_05616:
	\L_055c2:
	ZH 1:
	'Elisabeth Des assists us as a'
	R
	'volunteer.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_05552:
	ZH 1:
	'Hoh...'
	R
	'Not just cute, but kind as'
	R
	'well...'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_055fa:
	ZH 1:
	'Rance’s statement caused'
	R
	'Elisabeth to blush, and she'
	R
	'looked down.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_0556e:
	ZH 1:
	'Mm... I like her...'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_05552:
	ZH 1:
	'Hey, Pope.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_0558a:
	ZH 1:
	'Rance called quietly to'
	R
	'Mulalaloux.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_055c2:
	ZH 1:
	'Yes, what is it?'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_05552:
	ZH 1:
	'I want that girl.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_0558a:
	ZH 1:
	'Rance whispered.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_055c2:
	ZH 1:
	'What...? You want Elisabeth?'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_05552:
	ZH 1:
	'Yeah.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_055c2:
	ZH 1:
	'............'
	\L_05677:
	ZH 1:
	'Understood.'
	R
	'If it’s for the King of Leazas,'
	R
	'then very well.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_0556e:
	ZH 1:
	'Lucky me!'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_055c2:
	ZH 1:
	'Elisabeth.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_055b4:
	!VAR0516 : 38!
	\L_055a6:
	\L_05552:
	ZH 1:
	'Yes, Your Holiness?'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_055c2:
	ZH 1:
	'Will you listen to my request?'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_05552:
	ZH 1:
	'Of course!'
	R
	'I would do anything.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_055c2:
	ZH 1:
	'Then go with the King of'
	R
	'Leazas, and assist him at his'
	R
	'side. Is that acceptable?'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_05552:
	ZH 1:
	'Yes... Understood.'
	R
	'If it’s for you, Your Holiness.'
	\L_05677:
	ZH 1:
	'I would like to write to my'
	R
	'parents to tell them what I’m'
	R
	'doing, though...'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_055c2:
	ZH 1:
	'That isn’t a problem.'
	R
	'I can have somebody else write'
	R
	'them for you.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_05552:
	ZH 1:
	'Yes... Please do...'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_055c2:
	ZH 1:
	'You’re a good girl, Elisabeth.'
	R
	'I have no doubt that God is'
	R
	'watching over you.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_05552:
	ZH 1:
	'Yes...'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_055c2:
	ZH 1:
	'Now, King Rance.'
	R
	'Please take Elisabeth home'
	R
	'with you.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_05552:
	ZH 1:
	'I’m in your care.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_055b4:
	!VAR0516 : 1!
	\L_055a6:
	\L_05552:
	ZH 1:
	'Mhm.'
	R
	'Happy to have you.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_0558a:
	ZH 1:
	'Rance received Elisabeth Des.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
