	\L_055c2:
	ZH 1:
	'King Rance, would you allow us'
	R
	'to join your crusade, as well?'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_05552:
	ZH 1:
	'Hm?'
	R
	'What’s that mean?'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_055c2:
	ZH 1:
	'We’d like to help.'
	\L_05677:
	ZH 1:
	'We have soldiers known as'
	R
	'Temple Knights.'
	\L_05677:
	ZH 1:
	'Please use one of the Temple'
	R
	'Knight units.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_05552:
	ZH 1:
	'Use them...'
	R
	'You want us to fight alongside'
	R
	'them on the battlefield?'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_055c2:
	ZH 1:
	'Yes.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_05552:
	ZH 1:
	'Are they strong?'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_055c2:
	ZH 1:
	'Of course...'
	R
	'They have the protection of'
	R
	'God.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_05552:
	ZH 1:
	'That’s good.'
	R
	'I’ll borrow them, then.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_055c2:
	ZH 1:
	'Yes... Go ahead.'
	\L_05677:
