	\L_055a6:
	\L_0558a:
	ZM 32:
	ZH 1:
	'　　　　Kawanakajima'
	R
	ZM 24:
	ZH 1:
	R
	'  AL Church HQ'
	\L_05677:
	ZH 1:
	'Cell was walking down a'
	R
	'hallway that looked out into'
	R
	'the courtyard.'
	\L_05677:
	ZH 1:
	'Despite it being afternoon,'
	R
	'the sky was dull and gloomy.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_05552:
	ZH 1:
	'The weather looks bad...'
	R
	'I wonder if it will rain...'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_0558a:
	ZH 1:
	'Cell looked up at the dark sky'
	R
	'and muttered to herself.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_055b4:
	\L_0558a:
	ZH 1:
	'Meanwhile...'
	\L_05677:
	ZM 32:
	ZH 1:
	'　　AL Church HQ'
	R
	ZM 24:
	ZH 1:
	R
	'　Basement - Descent Room'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	!VAR0516 : 464!
	\L_055a6:
	\L_05552:
	ZH 1:
	'...Mah... Hakii... Nkereh...'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_0558a:
	ZH 1:
	'Pope Mulalaloux was alone,'
	R
	'chanting a mysterious'
	R
	'incantation.'
	\L_05677:
	ZH 1:
	'　　＜wah... ngh...）'
	\L_05677:
	ZH 1:
	'The light glittered and'
	R
	'condensed. It made a sound like'
	R
	'a harp.'
	\L_05677:
	ZH 1:
	'Then it took its true form.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	!VAR0516 : 485!
	\L_05616:
	\L_055c2:
	ZH 1:
	'You’re the one who summoned me,'
	R
	'Mulalaloux?'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_055fa:
	ZH 1:
	'The being that Mulalaloux'
	R
	'summoned was an angel knight.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_05552:
	ZH 1:
	'Yes, Lord Leda...'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_055fa:
	ZH 1:
	'Mulalaloux prostrated himself'
	R
	'before Leda,'
	\L_05677:
	ZH 1:
	'presumably because he believed'
	R
	'raising his head to be'
	R
	'presumptuous.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_055c2:
	ZH 1:
	'To be scolded by me?'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_05552:
	ZH 1:
	'W-Well...'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_055c2:
	ZH 1:
	'Mulalaloux...'
	R
	'You have been negligent in'
	R
	'your duties imparted by us...'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_05552:
	ZH 1:
	'That’s not true!!'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_0558a:
	ZH 1:
	'Mulalaloux raised his head,'
	R
	'turned pale and shouted.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_055c2:
	ZH 1:
	'God desires chaos... Your job is'
	R
	'to induce continued strife'
	R
	'between all the human countries.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_05552:
	ZH 1:
	'That’s what I’m doing!!'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_055c2:
	ZH 1:
	'Then what is giving birth to'
	R
	'this force that strives to'
	R
	'unite the world...?'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_05552:
	ZH 1:
	'W-Well... I wasn’t expecting'
	R
	'that, myself...'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_055c2:
	ZH 1:
	'Mulalaloux...'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_05552:
	ZH 1:
	'I-I understand!!'
	\L_05677:
	ZH 1:
	'I’ll use all of the church’s'
	R
	'power to crush Leazas and return'
	R
	'the world to chaos.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_055c2:
	ZH 1:
	'...Hoh... It seems you do'
	R
	'understand.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_05552:
	ZH 1:
	'Yes!!'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_055c2:
	ZH 1:
	'In that case, do what you'
	R
	'said... That is God’s will...'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_05552:
	ZH 1:
	'O-Of course!!'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_05624:
	\L_0558a:
	ZH 1:
	'Mulalaloux returned to'
	R
	'prostrating himself, and while'
	R
	'he did Leda disappeared.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_05552:
	ZH 1:
	'............'
	\L_05677:
	ZH 1:
	'Haah...'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_0558a:
	ZH 1:
	'Mulalaloux wiped the sweat'
	R
	'from his brow and sat down.'
	\L_05677:
	\L_0566a:
	\L_05552:
	ZH 1:
	'Oh dear... This has gotten to be'
	R
	'trouble... Damn that foolish'
	R
	'King of Leazas...'
	\L_05677:
	ZH 1:
	'I didn’t think he’d make it'
	R
	'this far... I have to do'
	R
	'something...'
	\L_05677:
